     2093         buf_trn-doc.doc-type COLUMN-LABEL "Тип" FORMAT "x(3)"  LABEL-FGCOLOR 15 LABEL-BGCOLOR 1
     2094         status-edi-trn ( buffer buf_trn-doc )  @ v-status-trn-edi COLUMN-LABEL "Статус EDI" FORMAT "x(12)" LABEL-FGCOLOR 15 LABEL-BGCOLOR 1
     2095       WITH NO-ROW-MARKERS SEPARATORS SIZE 98 BY 5.21 FIT-LAST-COLUMN.
     2096   DEFINE FRAME Dialog-Frame
     2097        b-quit AT ROW 1 COL 1
     2098        b-sel AT ROW 1 COL 13
     2099        b-rep AT ROW 1 COL 25
     2100        b-sch AT ROW 1 COL 37
     2101        b-close AT ROW 1 COL 37
