     2480   ON CHOOSE OF r-cli IN FRAME Dialog-Frame
     2481   DO:
     2482   define variable rid-list as character no-undo .
     2483   define buffer b#clients for ub.clients.
     2484      run ref/cli-all.w ( parparentproc, input "b-sel", 'орг':U, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, output  rid-list).
     2485      find first b#clients where recid(b#clients) = integer(rid-list) no-lock no-error.
